{"id": "r_deck", "category": "real", "role": "body", "style": "Deck", "source": "A good layout is invisible. Here is what is going on underneath the page — from the baseline grid to the paragraph composer.", "prev": "Notes on the Grid", "next": "Evening light over layered hills — generated entirely in code for this sample.", "ref": {}, "identity_ok": false, "dnt": [], "glossary": {"tr": [["paragraph composer", "paragraf dizgi motoru"], ["baseline grid", "taban çizgisi ızgarası"]], "de": [["paragraph composer", "Absatzsetzer"], ["baseline grid", "Grundlinienraster"]]}, "case": null, "real": true, "short": false}
{"id": "r_caption_hills", "category": "real", "role": "caption", "style": "Caption", "source": "Evening light over layered hills — generated entirely in code for this sample.", "prev": "A good layout is invisible. Here is what is going on underneath the page — from the baseline grid to the paragraph composer.", "next": "Typography does the heavy lifting. A paragraph composer weighs every possible line break at once, trading a slightly loose line here for a much better one three lines later. The result is an even texture of type, free of rivers and ragged gaps, where hyphens appear only when they truly help.", "ref": {}, "identity_ok": false, "dnt": [], "glossary": {"tr": [], "de": []}, "case": null, "real": true, "short": false}
{"id": "r_body_1", "category": "real", "role": "body", "style": "Body", "source": "Typography does the heavy lifting. A paragraph composer weighs every possible line break at once, trading a slightly loose line here for a much better one three lines later. The result is an even texture of type, free of rivers and ragged gaps, where hyphens appear only when they truly help.", "prev": "Evening light over layered hills — generated entirely in code for this sample.", "next": "Images give a spread its pulse. A strong photograph bleeds off the edge of the page, while smaller pictures sit inside the grid and let the text wrap around them. Captions, pull quotes and running heads add layers that a careful reader can explore at their own pace.", "ref": {}, "identity_ok": false, "dnt": [], "glossary": {"tr": [["paragraph composer", "paragraf dizgi motoru"]], "de": [["paragraph composer", "Absatzsetzer"]]}, "case": null, "real": true, "short": false}
{"id": "r_body_2", "category": "real", "role": "body", "style": "Body", "source": "Images give a spread its pulse. A strong photograph bleeds off the edge of the page, while smaller pictures sit inside the grid and let the text wrap around them. Captions, pull quotes and running heads add layers that a careful reader can explore at their own pace.", "prev": "Typography does the heavy lifting. A paragraph composer weighs every possible line break at once, trading a slightly loose line here for a much better one three lines later. The result is an even texture of type, free of rivers and ragged gaps, where hyphens appear only when they truly help.", "next": "Color holds it all together. A restrained palette of two or three swatches, applied consistently to headlines, rules and backgrounds, gives a publication its voice. Spot inks, tints and gradients are all just named swatches, so a single change ripples through every page.", "ref": {}, "identity_ok": false, "dnt": [], "glossary": {"tr": [["pull quotes", "öne çıkan alıntılar"], ["heads", "başlıklar"], ["grid", "ızgara"]], "de": [["pull quotes", "Pull-Quotes"], ["heads", "Überschriften"], ["grid", "Raster"]]}, "case": null, "real": true, "short": false}
{"id": "r_body_3", "category": "real", "role": "body", "style": "Body", "source": "Color holds it all together. A restrained palette of two or three swatches, applied consistently to headlines, rules and backgrounds, gives a publication its voice. Spot inks, tints and gradients are all just named swatches, so a single change ripples through every page.", "prev": "Images give a spread its pulse. A strong photograph bleeds off the edge of the page, while smaller pictures sit inside the grid and let the text wrap around them. Captions, pull quotes and running heads add layers that a careful reader can explore at their own pace.", "next": "Behind the scenes, styles are the secret to working fast. Paragraph styles define the voice of each element, character styles pick out emphasis, and object styles keep frames consistent. Change a style once and the whole document follows, from the cover to the very last page.", "ref": {}, "identity_ok": false, "dnt": [], "glossary": {"tr": [["swatches", "renk örnekleri"], ["rules", "çizgiler"]], "de": [["swatches", "Farbfelder"], ["rules", "Linien"]]}, "case": null, "real": true, "short": false}
{"id": "r_body_4", "category": "real", "role": "body", "style": "Body", "source": "Behind the scenes, styles are the secret to working fast. Paragraph styles define the voice of each element, character styles pick out emphasis, and object styles keep frames consistent. Change a style once and the whole document follows, from the cover to the very last page.", "prev": "Color holds it all together. A restrained palette of two or three swatches, applied consistently to headlines, rules and backgrounds, gives a publication its voice. Spot inks, tints and gradients are all just named swatches, so a single change ripples through every page.", "next": "And when the layout is done, the document must travel: to a printer as a press-ready PDF with bleed and crop marks, to a colleague as an open interchange file, or to a screen as a crisp image. A layout tool earns its keep by making every one of those journeys effortless.", "ref": {}, "identity_ok": false, "dnt": [], "glossary": {"tr": [], "de": []}, "case": null, "real": true, "short": false}
{"id": "r_body_5", "category": "real", "role": "body", "style": "Body", "source": "And when the layout is done, the document must travel: to a printer as a press-ready PDF with bleed and crop marks, to a colleague as an open interchange file, or to a screen as a crisp image. A layout tool earns its keep by making every one of those journeys effortless.", "prev": "Behind the scenes, styles are the secret to working fast. Paragraph styles define the voice of each element, character styles pick out emphasis, and object styles keep frames consistent. Change a style once and the whole document follows, from the cover to the very last page.", "next": "Every image, swatch and paragraph in this sample is generated in code — no stock assets.", "ref": {}, "identity_ok": false, "dnt": [], "glossary": {"tr": [["bleed", "taşma payı"]], "de": [["bleed", "Anschnitt"]]}, "case": null, "real": true, "short": false}
